+++
title: About Yomonsni
+++

## Our mission

Yomonsni exists to help people move forward from exactly where they are —
not from where they wish they were, not from where someone else thinks
they should be. Every coach here works from the same starting point:
you're not broken, and you don't need fixing. You need someone in your
corner while you figure out the next step.

## What is coaching?

Coaching isn't therapy, and it isn't consulting. A therapist often helps
you understand and process the past; a consultant tells you what to do. A
coach does neither — a coach asks the questions that help you find your
own answer, and holds you accountable to the steps you decide on
yourself.

Sessions are built around whatever's actually alive for you right now,
not a fixed curriculum. Some people come with a specific goal. Some come
because something feels stuck and they can't yet name what. Both are a
reasonable place to start.
